{
    "title": "Idle Guy: Life Simulator games",
    "description": "Idle Guy: Life Simulator games is a mobile application, a life simulation game in which absolutely everything is available! Real life simulator! Adventures in a real life business simulator are waiting for you. Build a Rich Inc. campaign in the world of a life simulator!  Simulator of an idle life in which absolutely everything is available!\r\n\r\n      Go from a poor man on the street to a real millionaire! Become a real office tycoon! Prove that you are worthy of a rich and idle life! Choose the rich, idle life of a billionaire! All in your hands! Build your own business. Build your business empire! Become the emperor of the business world! Become Mr. Billion a rich idle office tycoon! The game is a simulation of the rich life of a billionaire and an office magnate of a huge business empire!\r\n\r\n      Begin your career as an unemployed guy without home or money. Real, idle and rich life in our gaming mobile real life simulator! \r\n\r\nLife Simulation:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0e - Begin your life as a poor guy without any money, job or home and improve it!\r\n\ud83c\udf2d - Find money for food.\r\n\ud83d\udc55 - Buy yourself clothes and your first room in dormitory.\r\n\ud83c\udf93 - Get enrolled at university and progress to earn more.\r\n\ud83d\udcaa - Trade in the stock market.\r\n\ud83c\udfe2 - Climb up the corporate ladder.\r\n\ud83d\ude0d - Find yourself a girlfriend and make a virtual family.\r\n\ud83c\udfe5 - Don\u2019t forget to go to the hospital, treat your character and take him to resorts.\r\n\ud83c\udf89 - Go bowling, play pool, attend the concerts to increase happiness.\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 - Start your own business and earn your first million.\r\n\ud83d\udcaf - Become a head of the World Bank if you manage to go through all the challenges and not die of old age. \r\n\r\n       Real Idle Office Tycoon manages money like a game! Prove that you are worthy to become one! Idle tycoon billionaire, poor man, rich man, business emperor, money boss, cash master - choose who you will become in our game!\r\n\r\n       Create your own success story! Make a choice! Good or bad? poor man or rich man? Hit the bank or create a business empire? Make a choice! Do you like adventures? Do you like a real life simulator? Do you like being a capitalist magnat? Everything is available in our game! Join our business idle family!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Idle Guy: Life Simulator games is a mobile application, a life simulation game in which absolutely everything is available! Real life simulator! Adventures in a real life business simulator are waiting for you. Build a Rich Inc. campaign in the world of a life simulator!  Simulator of an idle life in which absolutely everything is available!<br><br>      Go from a poor man on the street to a real millionaire! Become a real office tycoon! Prove that you are worthy of a rich and idle life! Choose the rich, idle life of a billionaire! All in your hands! Build your own business. Build your business empire! Become the emperor of the business world! Become Mr. Billion a rich idle office tycoon! The game is a simulation of the rich life of a billionaire and an office magnate of a huge business empire!<br><br>      Begin your career as an unemployed guy without home or money. Real, idle and rich life in our gaming mobile real life simulator! <br><br>Life Simulation:<br><br>\ud83d\ude0e - Begin your life as a poor guy without any money, job or home and improve it!<br>\ud83c\udf2d - Find money for food.<br>\ud83d\udc55 - Buy yourself clothes and your first room in dormitory.<br>\ud83c\udf93 - Get enrolled at university and progress to earn more.<br>\ud83d\udcaa - Trade in the stock market.<br>\ud83c\udfe2 - Climb up the corporate ladder.<br>\ud83d\ude0d - Find yourself a girlfriend and make a virtual family.<br>\ud83c\udfe5 - Don\u2019t forget to go to the hospital, treat your character and take him to resorts.<br>\ud83c\udf89 - Go bowling, play pool, attend the concerts to increase happiness.<br>\ud83d\udcb2 - Start your own business and earn your first million.<br>\ud83d\udcaf - Become a head of the World Bank if you manage to go through all the challenges and not die of old age. <br><br>       Real Idle Office Tycoon manages money like a game! Prove that you are worthy to become one! Idle tycoon billionaire, poor man, rich man, business emperor, money boss, cash master - choose who you will become in our game!<br><br>       Create your own success story! Make a choice! Good or bad? poor man or rich man? Hit the bank or create a business empire? Make a choice! Do you like adventures? Do you like a real life simulator? Do you like being a capitalist magnat? Everything is available in our game! Join our business idle family!",
    "summary": "Life Business empire rich game. Boss millionaire idle games. Idle office tycoon",
